===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar}} {{term|حزب الله|lang=ar|tr=Hizbu-llāh||party of God}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[radical]] [[political]] and military [[Shi'a|Shi'ite Muslim]] organization that arose after the [[Israeli]] [[invasion]] of [[Lebanon]]; often accused of [[terrorism]].

